  <h2>Career</h2>
  <p>
    Began his career as a front-end engineer at a software development company, working
    on a telecom carrier's core customer management system and customer-facing web
    applications, gaining hands-on understanding of software development workflows.
  </p>
  <p>
    Went independent in 2022 and now focuses on web production, online shop builds, and
    UX/UI design for business systems — providing branding and direction across these areas.
  </p>

